    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c09-t9.11-p006",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**পরমমমান ফাংশন (Absolute Value Function)**\nযদি $x \\in R$ হয় তবে\n$$y = f(x) = |x| = \\begin{cases} x & যখন  x \\ge 0 \\\\ -x & যখন  x < 0 \\end{cases}$$\nকে পরমমমান ফাংশন বলা হয়।\n$\\therefore$ ডোমেন $D_f = R$ এবং রেঞ্জ $R_f = [0, \\infty)$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "x \\in R",
        "y = f(x) = |x| = \\begin{cases} x & যখন  x \\ge 0 \\\\ -x & যখন  x < 0 \\end{cases}",
        "\\therefore",
        "D_f = R",
        "R_f = [0, \\infty)"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 221,
      "pdfPageEnd": 221,
      "printedPageStart": 216,
      "printedPageEnd": 216,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "latin-junk",
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
